@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Edit sensor"; ViewData["Page"] = "sensor-edit"; }
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">DEVICE CONFIGURATION</span><h1>Refine the configuration.</h1><p>Give each signal an identity and a meaningful place.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/Sensors">← Back to registry</a></div><div class="form-grid"><section class="panel form-panel"><form id="sensor-form"><div class="section-index">01 / IDENTITY</div><label for="sensor-id">MAC address or unique identifier<input id="sensor-id" name="id" required pattern="[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9:_-]{2,63}" maxlength="64" placeholder="e.g. ESP32-NORTH-01" /><small>3–64 letters, digits, colons, hyphens or underscores.</small></label><label for="sensor-name">Display name<input id="sensor-name" name="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. North canopy temperature" /></label><div class="section-index">02 / DEPLOYMENT</div><label for="sensor-location">Location<select id="sensor-location" required><option value="">Loading locations…</option></select></label><label for="sensor-category">Category<select id="sensor-category"><option value="Environmental">Environmental · float / °C</option><option value="PowerConsumption">Power consumption · integer / W</option><option value="Actuator">Actuator · boolean / valve state</option></select></label><label for="sensor-interval">Expected reporting interval (seconds)<input id="sensor-interval" type="number" min="1" max="3600" value="3" required /></label><div id="form-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></div><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save sensor ↗</button></form></section><aside class="editorial"><span class="eyebrow">A BETTER SIGNAL STARTS HERE</span><h2>Context is part<br />of the reading.</h2><p>A temperature without a location tells only half the story. Connect every device to its deployment zone so unusual readings lead to a useful investigation.</p><div class="info-rule"><b>Typed by design</b><p>Your category determines the expected payload. Incorrect types are rejected at the gateway.</p></div><div class="info-rule"><b>Cadence-aware health</b><p>After three missed reporting intervals, a previously active sensor is marked disconnected.</p></div></aside></div>
